<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_820_2229.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unsser</unclear> früntlich willig dienst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovorn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fromen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Für</unclear>-
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sichtigen</unclear>, Ersamen und wysen, sonnders lieben und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>fründ, Demnach dann unser lieber herr, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoter</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>fründ, der <persName resp="#ner">Graaff zuo Tengen</persName>. bißhar uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weyhnir</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>unsere <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuchenmerckt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waegenlast</unclear> korn,
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoverkauffen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gfuert</unclear>, Welliches diser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thüren</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zyth</unclear>, dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeinen</unclear> armen man, unnd denen, so
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">marckt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bsuochend</unclear> unnd bruchend, zu guotem
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">greicht</unclear>, Also das man das korn, dester <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehr</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>einem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zimlicheren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gaelt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kauffen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kuenen</unclear>, Unnd et-
<lb n="11"/>lich üwer .<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. burger <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kornfuerer</unclear> die, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinuß</unclear> gen
<lb n="12"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-345" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Tengen</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kert</unclear>, unnd dem Graafen das korn, by dem
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laeger</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Samendhafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abkaufft</unclear>. Welliches <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">marckt</unclear> zuo nachteyl unnd schaden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kneycht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Diewyl</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> üwer .<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgeren</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bißhar</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frygen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kauff</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>wie annderen unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpuren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoglassen</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="17"/>sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füro</unclear> korn. so uff unnsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">marckt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diendte</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bim</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laeger</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffkauffen</unclear> moechten, Lanngt an üwer .<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">W</unclear>.
<lb n="19"/>unser guote fründ, unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">früntlichs</unclear> pitt, Ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellind</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>üwer burger, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">korn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerend</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellichem</unclear> Irem
<lb n="21"/>fürnemen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abzuostan</unclear> wysen, Das derglych <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferrer</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>von Inen nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">praucht</unclear> werde, Unnd üch als guote fründ,
<lb n="23"/>unnd wie ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welten</unclear>, sich unser burger, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">marckt</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bsuochtend</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hielten</unclear>, erzoeygen, Das wellend gegen
<lb n="25"/>üwer .W. unnd die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> allweg früntlich verdienen,
<lb n="26"/>Bittend by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zoeyger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dems</unclear> geschrifftliche antwurt. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dath</unclear> uff <origDate when="1561" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Liechtmeß</unclear> Anno <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear> 1561</origDate>
<lb n="28"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rath
<lb n="29"/>zuo Stein am <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ryn</unclear> etc</orgName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_820_2230.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_820_2231.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_820_2232.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="30"/>Den frommen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear>, ersammen
<lb n="31"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wysen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd
<lb n="32"/>Raath der statt Sant Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unse=</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ren</unclear> sunders lieben und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendten</unclear>,
